WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.800
A production automation pipeline built in n8n.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Starting with REST APIs: configuring HTTP Request nodes with dynamic query parameters to ingest live endpoint data.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:25.500
For complex data manipulation, JavaScript Code nodes transform nested arrays using dollar-input dot-all.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:35.000
Python validation separates valid records from invalid payloads into dedicated branches.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:47.000
Clean data is stored in n8n Data Tables with unique key matching and atomic upserts.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:59.000
To ensure idempotency, workflows query existing rows first, routing duplicate records to do nothing.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:11.000
Chapter 2 scales throughput: batching items with Loop Over Items and rate-limiting with Wait nodes.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:22.500
Flattening nested line items with Split Out, then aggregating grouped revenue with Summarize nodes.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:34.000
Calculating per-item profit margins across split records and re-aggregating batch summaries.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:44.500
Modular architecture: encapsulating complex business logic into reusable sub-workflows.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:57.000
Chapter 3 adds production resilience: multi-stage validation checkpoints catching malformed fields early.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:08.000
Dedicated Error Trigger nodes capture exceptions and dispatch structured alert notifications.

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:20.000
HTTP nodes continue using error output, routing failed network calls to dedicated fallback paths.

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:31.000
Run metrics track throughput, and an automated 95 percent quality gate halts execution if error thresholds are exceeded.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:43.000
The capstone project combines all techniques into a 17-node observable pipeline processing 1,001 records end to end.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:53.000
Production automation: APIs, custom code, tables, and resilience.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:59.500
